      "description": "A scene composed of a dead monkey with visible blood, juxtaposed with the text 'monkey blood'. The monkey is lying on its back, with blood around its mouth and face, and the text is overlaid at the bottom of the image. The scene is designed to evoke a visceral, disturbing reaction and is intended to perpetuate a hateful, racist stereotype by equating Black people with primates.",
