      "instance_name": "anti_black_stereotype_primate_comparison",
      "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Comparing Black People to Primates",
      "description": "This is a long-standing and deeply harmful racist trope that equates Black people with monkeys or other primates, used to dehumanize and demean them. The meme uses the image of a dead monkey with blood to visually reinforce this stereotype, implying that Black people are animal-like, violent, or inferior. This stereotype has been used historically in racist propaganda and continues to be perpetuated in hateful online content.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_e893a574"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
