      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "hateful_meme_intention",
      "label": "Hateful Meme Intent",
      "description": "The meme is designed to evoke disgust and reinforce racial prejudice by using graphic imagery and text to associate Black people with violence and animalism. The overall intent is hateful, as it targets a protected characteristic (race) and promotes dehumanization through a racist metaphor.",
