      "description": "The meme is an example of racial prejudice, specifically anti-Black racism, which involves negative attitudes, beliefs, or behaviors directed at Black people based on their race. The use of the monkey image and the text 'monkey blood' is a direct reference to a racist stereotype that has been used to justify discrimination and violence against Black individuals.",
