      "description": "This stereotype reduces a group of people to a lower, animalistic status, stripping them of their humanity and dignity. In this meme, the monkey is used as a symbol to represent Black people, implying they are violent, primitive, or less than human. This is a form of dehumanization that has been used historically to justify oppression and violence.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
