      "description": "The visual of a dead monkey with visible blood around its mouth and face, combined with the text 'monkey blood', is intended to evoke a visceral, repulsive reaction. The open, lifeless eyes and the graphic nature of the blood create a disturbing and nauseating emotional response.",
