      "description": "The meme is designed for an audience that either consciously or unconsciously reinforces or enjoys racist tropes that equate Black people with primates. This includes individuals who may be drawn to the graphic imagery and text to provoke a visceral reaction, or who are part of online communities that propagate such hateful content. The target audience is likely those who hold or are exposed to anti-Black racist ideologies, and who find the imagery and text offensive or provocative as a form of entertainment or social commentary, despite its deeply harmful nature.",
